## ⚙️ 3. Environment Configuration (`.env`)

Create or update the `.env` file on your Hostinger server. Update the variables below to align with your new domain and database credentials:

```env
APP_NAME="Digital Bank"
APP_ENV=production
APP_KEY=base64:mzw8xiKnl5Z0zb/ggmlPhWJ/mfQqi3JPfcXuyrXkIqk=
APP_DEBUG=false
APP_DEMO=false

# 1. New Domain Configuration (Ensure trailing slash is present)
APP_URL=https://your-new-domain.com/

# 2. Database Connection Credentials
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=your_new_database_name
DB_USERNAME=your_new_database_user
DB_PASSWORD=your_new_database_password

# 3. Secure Session Cookie Domain (Prepend with a leading dot for subdomain coverage)
SESSION_DOMAIN=.your-new-domain.com
SESSION_SECURE_COOKIE=true
SESSION_SAME_SITE=lax
```

> [!NOTE]
> Make sure to update the database values (`DB_DATABASE`, `DB_USERNAME`, `DB_PASSWORD`) inside Hostinger hPanel -> **Databases** -> **MySQL Databases** first.

