## ✉️ 5. Welcome Email & Routing Credentials

The welcome email sends automatic routing details, full names, checking account details, and savings account numbers when users complete verification.

To customize the email layout:
1. Log in to the Admin Dashboard.
2. Go to **Document Templates** under management.
3. Select **Edit** on the **FrontField FCU Welcome Letter** template (category: `welcome_letter`).
4. Update the content using the WYSIWYG editor.

### Supported Email Placeholder Tags (Shortcodes)
- `[[FULL_NAME]]` — Dynamic account name.
- `[[CHECKING_ACCOUNT_NUMBER]]` — Dynamic primary checking number.
- `[[SAVINGS_ACCOUNT_NUMBER]]` — Dynamic savings account number.
- `[[ROUTING_NUMBER]]` — Global bank routing transit number.
- `[[LOGIN_URL]]` — Direct banking login link.
- `[[LOGO_URL]]` — Configured bank logo URL.
- `[[SITE_TITLE]]` — Active Credit Union site title.
- `[[HOME_URL]]` — Dynamic app homepage.
- `[[HOME_DOMAIN]]` — Active hostname (domain only).
